To make it clear, this PR has a lot of collisions with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/30623. That PR adds a PROPERTY_USAGE_READ_ONLY flag that is used to determine if a property is read_only or not. You should add it in this PR too, and then, when building the tree, you should do something like:
```
bool property_read_only = (p.usage & PROPERTY_USAGE_CATEGORY) || read_only;
...
ep->set_read_only(property_read_only);
```

